{"3239330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tutien Path", "steam_appid": 3239330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*I am looking for a publisher for my game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Contact: <a href=\"mailto:tttriet1997@gmail.com)\">tttriet1997@gmail.com)</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tu Tien Path is a 3D Xianxia Cultivation game, Fantasy Adventure RPG in UNREAL ENGINE 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free on your own path in the world. But you will be loneliness, and very consistency if you want to go to the highest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a part of a web novel, Q-Style with stylized object model and colors world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239330/extras/ad7950eb79c0145b4de54ac4a060cd8d.avif?t=1788151852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239330/extras_big/ad7950eb79c0145b4de54ac4a060cd8d.avif?t=1788151852 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In mortal world, there are 5 levels in the Xianxia Cultivation Path that a normal human can achieve, of course you must spend blood and bone for it. Consistency and effort are not enough, luck will play a big part in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person – Adventure RPG – Action – Shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world – Flight - Stealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting – Building – Farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes – Hidden Objects – Life &amp; Immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story or Setting:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Xianxia World, almost think Survival of the Strongest, but there is one, don’t want to kill, but live in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For powerful Beasts, he tames. For extravagant people who want to kill him, he separates their body and soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the whole story, he never kills, but it doesn’t mean he is a good person, there is still a darkness inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System Requirements:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Benefits:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tu Tien Path contains philosophy of Buddhism, Confucianism and Taoism, self-help, mindset of a hard worker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Author word:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s just a game from a web-developer, it will go from bad to good as I will keep updating it for better new features or improvement in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will read all the comments and try to make it better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support will help me a lot, to live and develop the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please check out my game list:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, just English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youtube Chanel: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*I am looking for a publisher for my game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Contact: <a href=\"mailto:tttriet1997@gmail.com)\">tttriet1997@gmail.com)</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tu Tien Path is a 3D Xianxia Cultivation game, Fantasy Adventure RPG in UNREAL ENGINE 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free on your own path in the world. But you will be loneliness, and very consistency if you want to go to the highest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a part of a web novel, Q-Style with stylized object model and colors world.</